{"id":"vod_bf_23269","vodId":"23269","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"名侦探柯南剧场版 国语版","name_cn":"名侦探柯南剧场版 国语版","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第20集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-24/933eab7474b00626a378d39ffa274c6e.jpg"},"summary":"东京召开首脑会议，地点是东京湾的新设施「Edge of Ocean」。这是一座，会议举办的5月1日当天，将动用2万2千人警方人员的超巨大设施。然而不料某天，竟发生了突如其来的大规模爆炸事件！其中，出现了可以掌控全国公安警察的警察厅秘密组织——通称「ZERO」组织的成员安室透的身影。为何不在会议当天，而选择在会议之前引爆呢？以及安室背地里诡异的行为，让柯南感到事情蹊跷不已。这时，现场证物上留下的指纹，竟然与过去所属警视厅的毛利小五郎的指纹相吻合！其中到底有什么阴谋？围绕逮捕小五郎，柯南和安室展开了交战。安室透这个谜一般的存在，究竟是敌是友？「极秘任务」的倒计时，此时已经无声无息地开始了——","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:24:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":20,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanjuchangbanguoyuban/第11集/i